<component>
    <CaseDocPage
        title={t("case.date_picker.title")}
        description="DatePicker 日期选择器，支持 placeholder、cleanable、appearance、number-of-months、size 等属性。通过 ref 绑定到 ViewModel 同名字段，on-change 事件在日期变化时触发。"
        code-rml={rml_sample}
        code-rust={rust_sample}>
        <template slot="demo">
            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>1. 基础用法 + on-change 事件</h3>
                <p>DatePicker 通过 ref 绑定到 ViewModel 同名字段。选择日期后触发 on-change 事件。</p>
                <p>选中日期：{selected_date}</p>
                <DatePicker ref="basic_picker" on-change={on_date_change} />
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>2. placeholder + cleanable</h3>
                <p>placeholder 设置占位文本，cleanable 启用清除按钮（默认关闭）。</p>
                <DatePicker ref="cleanable_picker" placeholder="请选择日期" cleanable on-change={on_cleanable_change} />
                <p>清除后日期：{cleanable_date}</p>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>3. appearance=false 最小样式</h3>
                <p>appearance 默认 true，设为 false 移除边框与背景，适合自定义容器内嵌套使用。</p>
                <DatePicker ref="minimal_picker" appearance="false" on-change={on_minimal_change} />
                <p>最小样式日期：{minimal_date}</p>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>4. 尺寸 size</h3>
                <p>size 属性走通用 Sizable setter：xsmall / small / medium / large。点击按钮循环切换尺寸。</p>
                <p>当前尺寸：{size_label}</p>
                <div class="button-row">
                    <Button label="切换尺寸" on-click={on_cycle_size} />
                    <DatePicker ref="sized_picker" size={size_value} />
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>API</h3>
                <Table columns={api_columns} rows={api_rows} bordered />
            </div>
        </template>
    </CaseDocPage>
</component>
